{
  "sourceLanguage": "zh-Hans",
  "strings": {
    "%@ / %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%1$@ / %2$@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ / %@ · %@/s": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%1$@ / %2$@ · %3$@/s"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@前": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ ago"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld 个云盘%@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%1$lld drives: %2$@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Cloudreve 官网": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cloudreve Website"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "一行一个规则，仅匹配文件名，支持 * 和 ?；以 # 开头的行为注释。默认规则：%@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "One rule per line, matched against file names only; supports * and ?. Lines starting with # are comments. Default rules: %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "不支持的挂载路径：%@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Unsupported mount path: %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "云盘": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Drives"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "云盘「%@」需要重新登录": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Drive “%@” requires you to sign in again"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "云盘将继续同步。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The drive will continue syncing."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "云盘已出现在 Finder 侧栏的「位置」中，文件将按需下载。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The drive now appears under Locations in the Finder sidebar. Files download on demand."
